WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.649
One wrong number means
a public correction.

00:00:02.649 --> 00:00:07.887
NoCap: Muse Spark finds every number,
code checks it against SEC filings.

00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:11.055
An AI-drafted NVIDIA story,
two planted errors.

00:00:11.055 --> 00:00:14.822
Seven verified, two wrong,
two unverifiable. No guessing.

00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:17.342
Revenue up 18%
from a year ago?

00:00:17.342 --> 00:00:20.022
The receipt says 105.85%.

00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:22.481
18% was quarter
over quarter.

00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:27.200
GAAP EPS: $2.22 in the draft,
$2.46 in the filing.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.240
Fix: Muse Wonder proposes,
only digits may change.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.399
Recheck: nine verified,
zero wrong.

00:00:34.399 --> 00:00:39.593
Slides too: SAM 3.1 finds the charts,
Muse Spark reads 32 labels.

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:44.953
In testing, 306 of 360 planted errors
were caught, none passed as verified,

00:00:44.953 --> 00:00:47.606
and 17 of 1,298 true figures flagged.

00:00:47.606 --> 00:00:51.979
Its verified calls were right
736 of 738 times.

00:00:51.979 --> 00:00:54.665
Built for financial journalists and analysts.

00:00:54.665 --> 00:00:59.530
receipts-nocap.vercel.app,
live through November 17.
